# Maps — MapLibre, MapTiler, Locations app

**When:** location picker, space map, venue finder, embeddable “find us” map. **Not** turn-by-turn navigation (link out to Google/Apple Maps).

**Human ops reference:** `~/ovh/MAPS.md` · **Locations app source:** `~/apps/map-explorer` (`https://git.vtc.com/zeresoft/maps.git`)

---

## Two hostnames (do not confuse)

| Host | Role |
|------|------|
| **`maps.vtc.com`** | Static **Locations** app (Vite/React) — public map + admin CRUD UI |
| **`tiles.vtc.com`** | **TileServer GL** — MapLibre `style.json`, TileJSON, vector `.pbf` tiles |
| **`api.vtc.com`** | ZAPI — `/api/v1/public/map`, `/groups/{id}/locations`, `/map-config` |

Browser loads **basemap** from MapTiler (production default) or optionally `tiles.vtc.com`. **Pin data** always from ZAPI.

---

## Basemap: MapTiler (production default)

Production Locations app uses **MapTiler** `streets-v2` — reliable fonts, glyphs, and global coverage. Self-hosted `tiles.vtc.com` is optional and currently lacks font glyphs (labels break) unless TileServer fonts are fixed.

### Env vars (Vite / static SPA)

**Do not commit** MapTiler or platform map vars — build.vtc.com injects them (`env-development.mdc`). **Never** hardcode style URLs or API keys in components.

| Variable | Purpose | Source |
|----------|---------|--------|
| `VITE_MAPTILER_API_KEY` | MapTiler Cloud API key | Platform inject |
| `VITE_MAPTILER_STYLE_URL` | Style template with `{key}` placeholder | Platform inject |
| `VITE_MAP_STYLE_URL` | Platform self-hosted style | Platform inject |
| `VITE_TILE_STYLE_URL` | Self-hosted fallback (optional local dev) | `https://tiles.vtc.com/styles/basic-preview/style.json` |
| `VITE_PREFER_SELF_HOSTED_TILES` | Set `true` to prefer `VITE_TILE_STYLE_URL` | omit or `false` in production |
| `VITE_ZAPI_URL` / `VITE_VTC_API_URL` | Locations API | Platform inject |
| `VITE_APP_PUBLIC_URL` | Embed / public links | Build identity / app-specific |

### Style resolution (Locations app pattern)

```typescript
// ~/apps/map-explorer/src/lib/api.ts — tileStyleUrl()
// 1. MapTiler if VITE_MAPTILER_API_KEY is set (default)
// 2. Self-hosted only if VITE_PREFER_SELF_HOSTED_TILES=true
// 3. On style error, hook may fall back from tiles.vtc.com → MapTiler
```

### Next.js apps (other products)

| Runtime | Variable | Source |
|---------|----------|--------|
| Browser | `NEXT_PUBLIC_MAPTILER_API_KEY` | Platform inject |
| Browser | `NEXT_PUBLIC_MAPTILER_STYLE_URL` | Platform inject |
| Browser | `NEXT_PUBLIC_MAP_STYLE_URL` | Platform inject — `maps.vtc.com` style |
| Browser | `NEXT_PUBLIC_TILE_STYLE_URL` | `https://tiles.vtc.com/styles/basic-preview/style.json` (optional local dev) |

Use `maplibre-gl` (not Mapbox GL). Import CSS: `maplibre-gl/dist/maplibre-gl.css`.

```typescript
import maplibregl from 'maplibre-gl'

const map = new maplibregl.Map({
  container: ref.current!,
  style: import.meta.env.VITE_MAPTILER_STYLE_URL!.replace('{key}', import.meta.env.VITE_MAPTILER_API_KEY!),
  center: [-1.5491, 53.8008], // [lng, lat] — Leeds / GB default
  zoom: 6,
})
```

