## Self-hosted tiles (`tiles.vtc.com`)

TileServer GL on server4 (internal network); public TLS via server4 edu-traefik or server1 Caddy → vRack.

| Resource | URL |
|----------|-----|
| Style | `https://tiles.vtc.com/styles/basic-preview/style.json` |
| TileJSON | `https://tiles.vtc.com/data/v3.json` |
| Vector tiles | `https://tiles.vtc.com/data/v3/{z}/{x}/{y}.pbf` |

Data id **`v3`** in TileServer config (MBTiles file `vtc.mbtiles`, Great Britain). **Do not** use `maps.vtc.com` for tile URLs.

**Known issue:** `/fonts/...` on TileServer may return 400 — MapLibre labels fail. Prefer MapTiler for basemap until fonts are configured.

**Do not** proxy tiles through app `/api/*` — browser fetches `tiles.vtc.com` or `api.maptiler.com` directly.

