## Locations app (reference implementation)

Per-space (group) pins + map config. A **network is a space** — use `space_id` / `group_id` (community id).

### URLs

| Mode | URL |
|------|-----|
| Public | `https://maps.vtc.com/?space_id={id}` or `?space={slug}` |
| Admin (iframe in app.vtc.com) | `https://maps.vtc.com/?space_id={id}&token={JWT}&admin=1` |
| Deep link | `?space_id={id}&location={slug}` |

JWT from **app.vtc.com** login (`tag_api_v1`, `aud=zapi_server`). Token must be valid for `api.vtc.com`. **No** “dev token rejected” — same signing secret as production API.

Static host has **no** `/admin` SPA fallback — admin is `/?admin=1&token=JWT` or `/admin?token=JWT`. **Token alone on `/` is public** (platform “open as user” may still pass `token`).

### ZAPI (`https://api.vtc.com/api/v1`)

| Method | Path | Auth |
|--------|------|------|
| GET | `/public/map?space_id=` / `?space=` / `?host=` | none |
| GET/PUT | `/groups/{group_id}/map-config` | Bearer + space admin |
| GET/POST | `/groups/{group_id}/locations` | Bearer + space admin |
| PUT/DELETE | `/groups/{group_id}/locations/{id}` | Bearer + space admin |

Mongo: `space_map_config`, `space_locations`. Location fields include `kind`, `color` (hex pin colour), `lat`, `lng`, address, etc.

**CORS:** `api.vtc.com` must allow `*.vtc.com` origins (`CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGIN_REGEX` includes `vtc.com`). Admin fetches with `Authorization` trigger preflight.

### Deploy Locations frontend

Push to `zeresoft/maps` `main` → platform build → MinIO `users/1/apps/maps/`. Do not manual-upload `dist/` (gets overwritten).

```bash
cd ~/apps/map-explorer && npm run build && git push origin main
```

ZAPI locations routes live in `~/apps/dev/src/zapi` (`locations.py`, `locations_service.py`). Deploy ZAPI on server1 after API changes — see `~/ovh/MAPS.md`.

### MapLibre pitfalls (Locations app)

1. **Never set `transform` on `.maplibregl-marker` root** — MapLibre uses it for positioning; use `filter` / `z-index` for selected state.
2. **Do not `flyTo` on map click** when placing pins — only user drag should pan.
3. **Ignore map click after marker click** — same click bubbles to map and can start “add pin” mode.
4. **No `window.confirm` in admin UI** — sandboxed iframes on app.vtc.com block modals; use in-panel confirm buttons.
5. **Draft pin** — show preview marker before save (`__draft__` id); do not re-`fitBounds` on every draft coordinate change.

### Pin colours (not icons)

Default hex per `kind` (`poi`, `office`, `store`, …); user can override with custom colour. See `~/apps/map-explorer/src/lib/locationColors.ts`.

