## Attribution (required on every map)

MapTiler styles include required attribution in the style JSON; also show in app footer where applicable:

- MapTiler: `© MapTiler` + `© OpenStreetMap contributors` (per MapTiler ToS)
- Self-hosted OpenMapTiles: `© OpenMapTiles © OpenStreetMap contributors`

Use i18n keys where the app is translated (`map.attribution`).

---

## App checklist (new map feature)

1. Read this file + `~/ovh/MAPS.md` before coding
2. MapTiler + platform map vars are **platform-injected at build** — do not add to `.env.production`; local dev may use `NEXT_PUBLIC_MAP_STYLE_URL` / `VITE_TILE_STYLE_URL` without MapTiler (`env-development.mdc`)
3. Use `maplibre-gl`; handle loading / error / empty states (`ux-screens.mdc`)
4. Pin **data** from ZAPI or your API — basemap from MapTiler (or optional self-hosted)
5. Test inside **app.vtc.com iframe** (CORS, sandbox, no `confirm()`)
6. Default view: entity coords or GB; `fitBounds` once on load, not on every pin edit

